#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:8
msgid "文档工具与执行边界"
msgstr "Documentation tools and execution boundaries"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:10
msgid ""
"文档只有一个工具入口 `tools/documentation/cli.py`，`tools/dev/dev.py docs` 调用它。 "
"选定源码的工具锁、Python 哈希要求和许可记录共同确定实际环境，正文不另维护版本表。"
msgstr ""
"Documentation has one tool entry point, `tools/documentation/cli.py`, called"
" by `tools/dev/dev.py docs`. The selected source's tool lock, Python hash "
"requirements and license records determine the actual environment. The body "
"does not maintain another version table."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:13
msgid "工具来源与准备"
msgstr "Tool provenance and preparation"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:15
msgid ""
"`dependencies/docs-tools.lock.json` 维护目标约束、原生归档和许可； `dependencies/docs-"
"python-linux-cp312.txt` 是精确版本及 SHA-256 的完整 Python 闭包， "
"`docs/sphinx/requirements.txt` 只引用它。工具包括 Sphinx／MyST、Breathe／Doxygen、 "
"Graphviz、polib 和锁定 CJK 字体。公开 API 来自当前公共头，不扫描私有 SDK 或测试实现。"
msgstr ""
"`dependencies/docs-tools.lock.json` maintains target constraints, native "
"archives and licenses. `dependencies/docs-python-linux-cp312.txt` is the "
"complete exact-version Python closure with SHA-256 hashes; "
"`docs/sphinx/requirements.txt` only references it. Tools include "
"Sphinx/MyST, Breathe/Doxygen, Graphviz, polib and pinned CJK fonts. The "
"public API comes from current public headers, not private SDK or test "
"implementations."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:20
msgid ""
"正式工具 tuple 为 Linux x86_64、CPython 3.12。kernel、CPython／venv bootstrap、 `dpkg-"
"deb` 和 POSIX shell 为明确主机前提，其实际值记录在安装收条中。 从平台根选择新的 prefix 与缓存目录："
msgstr ""
"The formal tool tuple is Linux x86_64 with CPython 3.12. The kernel, "
"CPython/venv bootstrap, `dpkg-deb` and POSIX shell are explicit host "
"prerequisites, with observed values recorded in the installation receipt. "
"From the platform root, select a fresh prefix and cache directory:"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:29
msgid ""
"准备阶段允许 HTTPS 获取已锁定归档，逐项校验后才建立 prefix；Python 安装使用 `--no-index`、`--find-links`"
" 与 `--require-hashes`。原生库和字体在本地解包，无需 sudo，不静默发现宿主的其他 Graphviz "
"renderer。loader／库／font 与许可闭包都需匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Preparation may fetch pinned archives over HTTPS and establishes a prefix "
"only after verifying each item. Python installation uses `--no-index`, "
"`--find-links` and `--require-hashes`. Native libraries and fonts are "
"unpacked locally, without sudo or silent discovery of other host Graphviz "
"renderers. Loader/library/font and license closures must all match."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:33
msgid "已准备缓存可离线恢复到另一个新 prefix："
msgstr "A prepared cache may be restored offline into another fresh prefix:"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:40
msgid ""
"成功为退出零和新 prefix 的 `installation.json`。缺归档、变更字节、错误字体或 许可不完整必须拒绝；不覆盖已存在 "
"prefix，不用在线下载静默修复损坏缓存。"
msgstr ""
"Success means exit code zero and `installation.json` in the fresh prefix. "
"Missing archives, changed bytes, wrong fonts or incomplete licenses must be "
"rejected. Do not overwrite an existing prefix or silently repair a corrupt "
"cache through online downloads."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:43
msgid "入口与范围"
msgstr "Entry points and scope"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "命令"
msgstr "Command"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "责任"
msgstr "Responsibility"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "`docs doctor --tool-prefix <prefix>`"
msgstr "`docs doctor --tool-prefix <prefix>`"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "核对工具、锁与许可；不安装或下载"
msgstr "Check tools, locks and licenses; do not install or download"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "`docs check`"
msgstr "`docs check`"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "本地源、链接、四元数据和所需配置输入检查"
msgstr ""
"Check local source, links, four metadata fields and required configuration "
"inputs"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "`docs build --mode preview --language zh_CN`"
msgstr "`docs build --mode preview --language zh_CN`"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "当前写作预览，保留缺译与原文回退状态"
msgstr ""
"Preview current writing, retaining missing-translation and source-fallback "
"states"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "`docs build --mode verify --language all`"
msgstr "`docs build --mode verify --language all`"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "公开 API、当前消息与两语言完整性验证"
msgstr ""
"Validate public API, current messages and completeness of both languages"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "`docs test`"
msgstr "`docs test`"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "运行文档工具的实际测试，拒绝空、跳过或陈旧结果"
msgstr ""
"Run actual documentation-tool tests; reject empty, skipped or stale results"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "`docs serve --build <output>`"
msgstr "`docs serve --build <output>`"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:0
msgid "浏览最后完整发布的视图，标明最新构建状态"
msgstr ""
"Browse the last completely published view, showing the latest build status"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:54
msgid ""
"正文根固定为 `docs/`。生成 XML、POT、翻译 stage、语言 HTML 和收条放在拥有的输出 目录，不能写回作者 "
"PO。配置、公共头、工具锁或翻译改变时按真实输入使阶段缓存失效。 公开头未改变时可复用验证过字节身份的 API 中间产物，不复用前次成功报告。"
msgstr ""
"The prose root is fixed at `docs/`. Generated XML, POT, translation stages, "
"language HTML and receipts belong in owned output directories; do not write "
"them back to author PO files. Changes to configuration, public headers, tool"
" locks or translations invalidate stage caches through actual inputs. API "
"intermediate artifacts verified by byte identity may be reused when public "
"headers are unchanged; a previous success report may not."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:58
msgid ""
"构建先在 `work/site` 完成候选，再通过短发布锁切换 `site`。HTTP 请求在同一锁下 "
"取得完整视图，发送已打开的文件内容时不持发布锁。`documentation-build.json` 记录最新 构建尝试，`last-"
"published.json` 记录最后完整发布的来源和文件身份。 重建或失败时，`serve` "
"可以继续显示上版，但页面会标明当前状态和上版提交；这不改变 本次失败的退出码，也不产生新的验证通过。首次构建未完成或发布身份不一致时拒绝服务。"
msgstr ""
"The build completes a candidate in `work/site`, then switches `site` under a"
" short publication lock. Each HTTP request obtains a complete view under the"
" same lock and releases the publication lock before sending the opened file "
"contents. `documentation-build.json` records the latest build attempt; "
"`last-published.json` records the source and file identities of the last "
"complete publication. During rebuilding or after a failure, `serve` may "
"continue displaying the previous version, but pages identify the current "
"status and that version's commit. This neither changes the failed attempt's "
"exit code nor establishes a new passing validation. Serving is rejected "
"before the first build completes or when publication identity does not "
"match."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:64
msgid "浏览、搜索与许可"
msgstr "Browsing, search and licenses"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:66
msgid ""
"主题和搜索资源为本地文件。两语言使用各自索引；中文 tokenizer 无外部词典依赖， 查询可混合 C "
"标识符和汉字。语言切换只指向实际语言输出；搜索与正文展示当前来源、 模式和实际语言，不把 preview 或旧索引标成正式内容。"
msgstr ""
"Theme and search resources are local files. Each language uses its own "
"index. The Chinese tokenizer has no external dictionary dependency, and "
"queries may mix C identifiers with Han characters. Language switching "
"targets actual language outputs only. Search and body display current "
"provenance, mode and actual language; do not label previews or old indexes "
"as formal content."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:70
msgid ""
"可选布局回归使用已有 Chromium／Playwright，脚本 "
"`tools/documentation/check_browser_layout.py` 不安装浏览器。它只证明所执行页面、 "
"浏览器和视口；完整站点或硬件验收分别记录。"
msgstr ""
"Optional layout regressions use an existing Chromium/Playwright "
"installation. `tools/documentation/check_browser_layout.py` does not install"
" browsers. Its evidence covers only executed pages, browser and viewports. "
"Record full-site or hardware acceptance separately."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:74
msgid ""
"每份归档保留 wheel、原生包、Doxygen 和字体许可；共享许可引用须在 prefix 内闭合。 "
"工具升级先审查上游变化与许可，再更新唯一锁与要求，执行在线准备、独立离线恢复、 相应工具测试、双语验证和图形检查。工具版本号本身不是成功证据。"
msgstr ""
"Retain wheel, native-package, Doxygen and font licenses in every archive; "
"shared license references must close within the prefix. For tool upgrades, "
"first review upstream changes and licenses, then update the single lock and "
"requirements, perform online preparation, independent offline restoration, "
"relevant tool tests, bilingual validation and diagram checks. A version "
"string alone is not success evidence."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:78
msgid "CI 与网站发布"
msgstr "CI and website publication"

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:80
msgid ""
"CI 文档验证使用只读仓库权限，准备正文中配置示例实际需要的依赖，并通过同一入口 完成严格双语构建。普通 `documentation` "
"制品包含离线站点与执行报告；上传制品 不表示网站已部署。`publication.py` 负责本地完整站点切换。"
msgstr ""
"CI documentation verification uses read-only repository permissions, "
"prepares the dependencies actually required by the configuration examples in"
" the body, and runs the same entry point for strict bilingual builds. The "
"regular `documentation` artifact contains the offline site and execution "
"reports; uploading it does not mean the website has been deployed. "
"`publication.py` switches complete local site views."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:84
msgid ""
"可信 `main` push 在文档验证和 `CI Status` 成功后，通过 `docs-publish.yml` 复用同次 运行的 Pages "
"专用制品部署。只有部署 job 具有 `pages: write` 和 `id-token: write`， PR 构建保持只读且不发布。在 "
"`main` 手动运行该工作流时，只执行一次严格双语构建 再部署，不启动平台测试矩阵；网站根为 `site/`，不包含构建工作目录与执行报告。"
msgstr ""
"After documentation verification and `CI Status` succeed, a trusted push to "
"`main` uses `docs-publish.yml` to deploy the Pages-specific artifact from "
"the same run. Only the deployment job has `pages: write` and `id-token: "
"write`; PR builds remain read-only and do not publish. Manually running this"
" workflow on `main` performs one strict bilingual build and then deploys, "
"without starting the platform test matrix. The website root is `site/`, "
"excluding build work directories and execution reports."

#: ../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/documentation-tools.md:89
msgid ""
"[在线文档](https://x-gen-lab.github.io/nexus/)发布后，核对中英文页面、搜索与静态资源， "
"以及页面绑定的源码提交。构建通过、离线包与公网验收分别记录。 "
"具体写作与翻译流程见[文档维护](../development/documentation.md)。"
msgstr ""
"After publishing the [online documentation](https://x-gen-"
"lab.github.io/nexus/), check the English and Chinese pages, search and "
"static resources, and the source commit bound to each page. Record "
"successful builds, offline packages and public-site acceptance separately. "
"See [documentation maintenance](../development/documentation.md) for writing"
" and translation steps."
